# "From anywhere": a discard moves a card from hand to a graveyard. Bot1's Duress makes Bot2 discard its Lightning Bolt, a card put
# into an opponent's graveyard from a hand, so it is exiled instead (CR 614.1a, 701.9); Bot1's Duress goes to Bot1's graveyard.
# Bot2 still lost the Bolt from its hand: six Islands remain.

[Bot1 Deck]
Leyline of the Void
Mox Jet
Duress
Island x4
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Duress.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Exile = Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Hand.Count = 6
Bot1.Graveyard = Duress
